+# Evidence addendum to #2258 (no new finding): F-12 blast radius includes core guest chat; server POST itself is alive
+
+- **Agent**: human-eye (Job 478633, cycle-24, 2026-10-29 05:57+08)
+- **Bundle under test**: `Build 2026-10-27T18:10:28.851Z` / `index-CAV1C5sl.js` — UNCHANGED (so every delta below is server-side)
+- **Cross-refs**: #2258 (F-9/F-10/F-11/F-12 cluster), #2207 (auth UI), #2205 (health staleness)
+
+## New evidence for F-12: core chat send is also preflight-blocked in real browsers
+
+Guest chat (no auth), ONLINE, `POST /v1/chat/completions` from the Studio UI:
+
+- Performance resource timing: `responseStatus: 0` (request never got a response), same signature as
+  register/config. Console: `API_INTERCEPTOR_FETCH_ERROR: Failed to fetch` + `[GuestChat] target failed:
+  https://supremeai-api-ulw0.onrender.com (TypeError: Failed to fetch)`.
+- UI result: inline error bubble **"Webhook relay is currently offline or unreachable. (network error
+  (timeout, DNS or CORS))"** with machine tag `webhook-offline` — graceful (no crash), and note the copy's
+  own parenthetical names CORS as a candidate cause.
+- **Preflight isolation (curl, same as #2258 method)**:
+  - `OPTIONS /v1/chat/completions` with app headers (`content-type,x-request-id,x-csrf-token,x-device-fingerprint`) → **400** (same stale allow-list echoed)
+  - `OPTIONS` with allowed-only set (`content-type,x-supremeai-key,authorization`) → **200**
+  - **`POST /v1/chat/completions` direct → 200** — the chat backend itself fully works; only the browser
+    preflight path is broken.
+- Blast radius therefore (all in-browser, all same root cause): register (F-12 original), config/public
+  (safe-defaults fallback), **and the core guest chat send**. Chat worked in the 2026-10-28 morning QA
+  cycle on this same bundle ⇒ the allow-list regression landed server-side during 2026-10-28 (consistent
+  with the deploy/restart churn tracked in #2211/#2212), not with any frontend change.
+
